      "name": "Research delegation and niche routing",
      "summary": "Keeps foreground discussion turns unblocked whenever answering or analysing exceeds a brief ~15-20 s lookup, immediately reporting scope, ETA, potential outcomes with implications, and any upfront clarification card while routing the background work either to…",
      "description": "Keeps foreground discussion turns unblocked whenever answering or analysing exceeds a brief ~15-20 s lookup, immediately reporting scope, ETA, potential outcomes with implications, and any upfront clarification card while routing the background work either to an active deep-niche specialist, across multiple niche specialists for cross-fertilization on domain bridges, or to a newly spawned niche specialist, write-ahead checkpointing the parent epic bean and Worktree/Branch/Scratch Lease Table at dispatch time (and reconciling via Process_StalledAgentTriage whenever resuming after another agent advanced the repo), and executing Process_EvidenceGatheringAndProvenance.",
      "enforcement": "strict",
